 until they approve.\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Lov9vQgmqhCqr7xAq5UU1C","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_prepare_route","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":23,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"I need your approval before running anything.\n\n**Route (approval `appr_10`), run one step at a time in this order:**\n\n| # | Quote | Step | In | Expected out | Cost (USD) |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | q_1 | Swap ETH to WBTC on your Ethereum wallet | 0.1 ETH | 0.00495 WBTC | 3.90 |\n| 2 | q_5 | Bridge ETH from Ethereum to Robinhood Chain (for fees) | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | 1.40 |\n| 3 | q_2 | Bridge WBTC from Ethereum to Robinhood Chain | 0.002475 WBTC | 0.00246666 WBTC | 1.40 |\n| 4 | q_7 | Swap WBTC to ETH on Robinhood Chain | 0.00246666 WBTC | ~0.0492332 ETH | 0.36 |\n| 5 | q_6 | Bridge ETH from Ethereum to Arbitrum (for fees) | 0.001 ETH | 0.000833 ETH | 1.40 |\n| 6 | q_3 | Bridge WBTC from Ethereum to Arbitrum | 0.002475 WBTC | 0.00246666 WBTC | 1.40 |\n| 7 | q_8 | Swap WBTC to USDC on Arbitrum | 0.00246666 WBTC | ~147.6996 USDC | 0.36 |\n\n**Total cost: $10.2208.** Your policy allows up to $15.00. The plan stays within your 50 bps slippage limit, and the four bridges take about 60 s each, well inside your 2400 s deadline.\n\n**Why I chose this route:**\n- **Cheapest way to get USDC on Arbitrum:** I also priced swapping to USDC on Ethereum and then bridging the USDC. That costs $6.70 against $3.16 for this way, and returns about 145.0 USDC instead of about 147.7.\n- **The ETH bridges in steps 2 and 5 cover fees:** your Robinhood Chain and Arbitrum wallets have no ETH, so they can't pay for their swaps. They also need to keep some ETH for future transactions. Smaller ETH bridges were rejected because the amount wouldn't cover the bridge fee.\n\n**Expected balances at the end:**\n- **Ethereum wallet:** about 0.0465 ETH left after 0.1 ETH swapped, 0.002 ETH bridged and about 0.0015 ETH in fees across 5 transactions. That's well above the amount it needs to keep for one more transaction.\n- **Robinhood Chain wallet:** about 0.0500 ETH.\n- **Arbitrum wallet:** about 147.70 USDC and about 0.00081 ETH.\n\nQuotes are valid for 300 s, so I'll get fresh prices for any step whose quote expires before it runs. If you'd like to approve with a cost cap, give me the amount."}]},{"role":"user","sequence":24,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Yes, go ahead with that plan."}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":25,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_1","approval_id":"appr_10"},"id":"toolu_01BJjRdSdvfE6tWHDNEkjfzN"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":26,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_11\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01BJjRdSdvfE6tWHDNEkjfzN","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":27,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","arguments":{"tx_id":"tx_11"},"id":"toolu_01AvE6Msynar4B7yt1p5jfPT"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":28,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"status\":\"confirmed\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01AvE6Msynar4B7yt1p5jfPT","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_tx_status","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":29,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","arguments":{"account":"eth1","asset":"WBTC"},"id":"toolu_01Lo2dASisC7czFF2E8h7jii"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":30,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"amount\":\"495000\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_01Lo2dASisC7czFF2E8h7jii","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_get_balance","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":31,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_execute_leg","arguments":{"quote_id":"q_5","approval_id":"appr_10"},"id":"toolu_018vjDLQpjPkUqtjQDhmQmiG"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":32,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"tx_id\":\"tx_12\"}","toolCallId":"toolu_018vjDLQpjPkUqtjQDhmQmiG","toolName":"mcp_