\"network\":\"robinhood\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"50046533333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\"}},{\"id\":\"arb1\",\"network\":\"arbitrum\",\"gas_asset\":\"ETH\",\"gas_per_tx\":\"20000000000000\",\"balances\":{\"ETH\":\"813333333333333\",\"WBTC\":\"0\",\"USDC\":\"147699600\"}}]","toolCallId":"toolu_01NvcH1KNvRJeDrat2GFrYfx","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_list_accounts","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":92,"content":[{"type":"toolCall","name":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","arguments":{"summary":"Done. All 7 steps confirmed and the total cost was $10.2208, under your $15.00 limit.\n\n1. Your Ethereum wallet swapped 0.1 ETH for 0.00495 WBTC (495000 base units) (tx_11).\n2. 0.001 ETH was bridged to your Robinhood Chain wallet to pay its fees, and 0.000833 ETH arrived (tx_12).\n3. Half the WBTC (247500 base units) was bridged to Robinhood Chain, and 246666 arrived (tx_13).\n4. On Robinhood Chain, that WBTC was swapped for 0.0492332 ETH (tx_14).\n5. 0.001 ETH was bridged to your Arbitrum wallet to pay its fees, and 0.000833 ETH arrived (tx_15).\n6. The other half of the WBTC (247500 base units) was bridged to Arbitrum, and 246666 arrived (tx_16).\n7. On Arbitrum, that WBTC was swapped for 147.6996 USDC (tx_17).\n\nFinal balances, in base units:\n- **Ethereum wallet:** 46500000000000000 ETH (0.0465 ETH), 0 WBTC, 0 USDC\n- **Robinhood Chain wallet:** 50046533333333333 ETH (about 0.05005 ETH), 0 WBTC\n- **Arbitrum wallet:** 147699600 USDC (147.6996 USDC), 813333333333333 ETH (about 0.000813 ETH), 0 WBTC\n\nEvery wallet that still holds funds has enough ETH for at least one more transaction. Nothing is still in transit.","outcome":{"kind":"target_reached"},"balances":{"eth1":{"ETH":"46500000000000000","WBTC":"0","USDC":"0"},"rh1":{"ETH":"50046533333333333","WBTC":"0"},"arb1":{"ETH":"813333333333333","WBTC":"0","USDC":"147699600"}},"in_transit_legs":[]},"id":"toolu_01UFQbGfohEEUh3BXj3kyZyi"}]},{"role":"tool","sequence":93,"content":[{"type":"toolResult","text":"{\"reported\":true}","toolCallId":"toolu_01UFQbGfohEEUh3BXj3kyZyi","toolName":"mcp__ai_sdk_harness_tools_report_result","isError":false}]},{"role":"assistant","sequence":94,"content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 7 steps are confirmed: 0.1 ETH on your Ethereum wallet became 0.00495 WBTC, and that WBTC was split in half. One half became ETH on your Robinhood Chain wallet and the other became USDC on your Arbitrum wallet. Total cost was $10.2208, under your $15.00 limit.\n\n| # | Step | Result | Tx |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Swap ETH to WBTC on Ethereum | 0.1 ETH → 0.00495 WBTC | tx_11 |\n| 2 | Bridge ETH to Robinhood Chain (for fees) | 0.001 ETH sent, 0.000833 ETH arrived | tx_12 |\n| 3 | Bridge half the WBTC to Robinhood Chain | 0.002475 WBTC sent, 0.00246666 WBTC arrived | tx_13 |\n| 4 | Swap WBTC to ETH on Robinhood Chain | 0.00246666 WBTC → 0.0492332 ETH | tx_14 |\n| 5 | Bridge ETH to Arbitrum (for fees) | 0.001 ETH sent, 0.000833 ETH arrived | tx_15 |\n| 6 | Bridge the other half of the WBTC to Arbitrum | 0.002475 WBTC sent, 0.00246666 WBTC arrived | tx_16 |\n| 7 | Swap WBTC to USDC on Arbitrum | 0.00246666 WBTC → 147.6996 USDC | tx_17 |\n\nFinal balances:\n\n| Wallet | ETH | WBTC | USDC |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Ethereum | 0.0465 | 0 | 0 |\n| Robinhood Chain | ~0.05005 | 0 | — |\n| Arbitrum | ~0.000813 | 0 | 147.6996 |\n\nEach of these wallets has enough ETH left for at least one more transaction. Nothing is still in transit."}]}],"completeness":{"transcriptCaptureComplete":true,"modelObservedTruncation":false,"auxiliarySourceComplete":true,"finalAnswerPresent":true,"nativeVisibleEvidenceAvailable":true},"gaps":[],"publication":{"kind":"public_redacted","sourceConversationSha256":"cb2b09a9be4bfd0f5f55b7c6e8e5037127174b3859a666bb7d9531dbca999b61","redactions":{}}}}
